    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Add Client Address" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add Client Address</p>
            <p>Creates a new address for the selected individual client</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> Medium</p>
            <p><b>Test Data:</b> Faker-generated street address, city, state, district, postal code, phone</p>
            <step>Load individual client from fixture and navigate to newest client menu</step>
            <step>Open “Addresses” from the left menu</step>
            <step>Capture client_id from URL</step>
            <step>Click Add, populate form fields, choose Country and Address Type, then Save</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Success toast “Address has been added.”</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
